@Grundet.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Health check (DB connectivity ping, unauthenticated)
GET {{Grundet.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### OpenAPI spec (sanity check that the app started and endpoints are registered)
GET {{Grundet.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###
